Third-party code
================

recsys/src/models/ contains implementations of published recommenders, adapted to one training and
evaluation framework so that all models share the same data split, early-stopping rule and
full-ranking evaluator. They follow the original papers and, where one exists, the authors' public
implementation; those implementations remain under their original licenses, and credit belongs to
their authors:

  FREEDOM   Zhou & Shen, ACM MM 2023            LGMRec    Guo et al., AAAI 2024
  LightGCN  He et al., SIGIR 2020               VBPR      He & McAuley, AAAI 2016
  MMGCN     Wei et al., ACM MM 2019             LATTICE   Zhang et al., ACM MM 2021
  BM3       Zhou et al., WWW 2023               MGCN      Yu et al., ACM MM 2023
  MENTOR    Xu et al., AAAI 2025                DA-MRS    Xv et al., KDD 2024
  SMORE     Ong & Khong, WSDM 2025              COHESION  Xu et al., SIGIR 2025
  GUME      Lin et al., CIKM 2024

GUME, DA-MRS, SMORE and COHESION are ports of the official code; MENTOR and MMGCN are
re-implementations from the papers (MENTOR adds a normalization of its content residual).
The datasets (Amazon review data; MicroLens) are not redistributed; see README.md.
